  "detail_text": "The 356 ETSG is seeking information from potential vendors capable of providing specialized corrosion control services for government vehicles and equipment located on Guam and the CNMI. This Sources Sought Notice is issued for market research purposes in accordance with FAR Part 10. Interested vendors are encouraged to review the attached document, which includes: A detailed description of the requirement, A questionnaire for interested parties, and A disclaimer outlining the purpose and limitations of this notice. Responses are due no later than 2:00 PM Chamorro Standard Time (ChST) on April 15, 2026 . Submission instructions and contact information are provided in the attachment. Attachment: Sources Sought – Corrosion Control",
